Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:21.78,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Ship now entering warp navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.58,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew, prepare for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:28.91,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat: Ship now entering warp navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.00,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew, prepare for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:53.83,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Message from the XO.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:55.04,Announcement,,0,0,0,,We are currently still in warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:05:00.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,But we are encountering some complications as we assess the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismissed? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You have brought shame upon Lord Desler's plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are unable to deal with the Yamato problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then my own position is jeopardized,\Nas I recommended you for commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can deal with one or two Terron ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but "failure" is not a word in the Garmillas dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor in my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall await good news, Goer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, about that ship we lost contact with several days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But that ship has an Imperial Guard Information Officer on board...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! Only the Yamato does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the Yamato, and destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the Yamato's predicted trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be within this 7-korm area...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will assume command. Launch the fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We warp, and next thing you know, we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Destination coordinates entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Galactic longitude 274.76,\NGalactic latitude -12.73.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance is 63.7 parsecs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed. Coordinate axis fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Engine chamber pressure rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine pressure has reached critical point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,5... 4... 3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't how it usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Situation report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship appears to still be in warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're currently inhabiting the 1 nanosecond of the ship's warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This has never occurred before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The automatic navigation room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori, go and check the automatic navigation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's your own uncertainty that's causing the blurry vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want damage inspections now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on radar or scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like we can use hyperspace transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably only in here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Those only resonate within this space. We can't reach the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, it appears we've fallen into a dimensional rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where dimensions intersect...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, a dimensional fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy leak of unknown origin\Noccurring within the Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This area's space-time characteristics are inverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, the Wave Motion Engine\Nproduces infinite energy out of vacuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But in this place, it leaks energy to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning. Multiple unidentified objects ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a ship graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They were unable to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and wandered this alternate dimension for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A universal Sargasso Sea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas ship detected at eleven o'clock! Identified as L-class cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still on line...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garmillas ship is on alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We hold the firepower advantage, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If two lions mired in a bog fight one other, both will sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain they understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, enemy ship is hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open a channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, stand by in catapult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosmo Zero, on launch standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy plane has launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, this is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide the Garmillas plane to hangar 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole pretense of sending an envoy has to be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But they claimed to know how to escape this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, why have they not left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something we need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hangar 3 pressurized at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure rising. Oxygen in hangar now approaching normal levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Garmillan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to destroy humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They're human? That's a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly looks that way, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Her skin is blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can translate your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, I'd like to confirm something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a Terron ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Terron?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The one called "Yamato" or something similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower Storm Leader Ditz has docked with the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the Yamato,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a lucky break for a second-class Garmillas ship like yours, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Director-General Gimleh will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned Imperial Guard...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Melda Ditz, of the 707th Galactic Theater Air Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My rank is Lower Storm Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the ship's tactical officer, Susumu Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Within my empire's territory, there are others like you, without blue skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferior races from systems we've absorbed or from colonized planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The second-class Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're here to negotiate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you ask that I trust someone who brings a gun to meet a negotiator?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the Terrons enjoy war so much, they attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,without even a formal declaration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the ones who started this war!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, my family has held important military posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear by my family honor that I speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You lie! You were the ones who attacked us first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hear your proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. It's theoretically possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun generates a powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimensional Wave Motion along its line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:12:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If we aim at the dimensional fault's phase boundary,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,by our calculations, the waves of interference should clear an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did they know about the Wave Motion Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have been paying attention when we used it at Gliese 581.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But using the Wave Motion Gun would cost us most of our remaining energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It would knock the Yamato off-line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We promise that our ship will tow the Yamato to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a weapon to create an exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and you need someone to get you out, once the way is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't work together, we cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible they'll let us fire the Wave Motion Gun, and then escape alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the people telling us we're responsible for this war, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak, we're losing energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We must reach a swift conclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or even firing the Wave Motion Gun will become impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. There's no time to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do we do? Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached our decision. We'll agree to your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Vars Lang, Captain of the {\i1}EX-178{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Captain Juzo Okita of the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Lang, we thank you for your proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you, we have been stuck here, unable to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We thank you, as well, for acceding to our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower Storm Leader Ditz will remain there,\Nto serve as a point of contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You may take it as a gesture of our goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, a convenient hostage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But once we return to normal space, we will be enemies once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to exchanging fire with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmission over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If we use the Wave Motion Gun, we won't have energy for our main artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a promise between men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So Admiral Ditz's daughter stays with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Terrons must trust us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a beautiful stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,While not as splendid as a noble blue, red is a lovely color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Red is the color of my home. And it is my color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems quite important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Kodai's gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Both are mementos our beloved ones left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Incoming tow beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to emergency power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the Wave Motion Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing safety lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating force injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Final safety released.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tachyon particle pressure rising in chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas ship is leaving the firing line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage anti-shock and anti-flare defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Target scope open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Electronic cross-gauge, display brightness twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,4... 3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Exit has been created.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, the Yamato no longer has the power to move on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed fissure in dimensional boundary. It's an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship will commence towing the Yamato from the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas ship has begun to tow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, you don't plan to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an outsider here, Storm Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail to our Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tow beam output stabilized and normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The tow beam has been cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garmillas ship has sent a hyperspace transmission to the opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's encrypted, and we can't read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they do plan to escape and leave us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we get for believing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this was your plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who alerted Commander Goer that we found the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall report this treason upon our return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the traitor here, Captain. They're our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm an enemy, shoot me. Do not hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tow beam has been reconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on alert. For now, just focus on getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Three minutes until we reenter normal space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit is becoming unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintaining relative distance to Garmillas ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Detecting phase fluctuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Accelerating to 12 gat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pilot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need this thing between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tow beam released.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship has returned to regular space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Order Lower Storm Leader Ditz to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato, huh? A splendid enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendlies are Geschtaming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas fleet warping in, off our port bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}EX-178{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in our line of fire. You're in the way. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Goer, Admiral Ditz's daughter is aboard that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're under friendly fire! Evade! Evade!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}EX-178{\i} has been shot down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed destruction of {\i1}EX-178{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato shot down the missing ship we were searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happened, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, open fire on the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Exterior armor hit, port side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage control! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the ship around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape! Pursue and destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet is being annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge dimensional quake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A dimensional fault is forming at the epicenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Retreat! Jump out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But the flagship cannot retreat before issuing the order to the other ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you all want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet has been eradicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit from the rift tried to collapse into its original position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The reaction temporarily expanded the rift, sucking them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They said your prior destination no longer exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone lives with secret feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes courage to reflect on a horrible past and one's own mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.37,0:24:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But look toward to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.75,0:24:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to go forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato advances, on an unimaginably long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: A World I Once Saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 323 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:46.34,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}That girl was waving
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:50.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:58.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Who do you think it was for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:02.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Whoever it was
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:06.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It doesn’t matter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:15.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Let each think it was for him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:23.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The hearts of men beginning a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:30.60,ED,,0,1100,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Want a piece of romance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.67,0:23:50.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}A bright {\c&H0000FF&}red scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:29.54,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(2000,1800)}{\pos(1320,840)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:29.54,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(2000,1800)}{\pos(1126,1073)}Graveyard of the Universe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:35.74,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fad(1000,1000)}{\pos(960,1035)}Balun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:10:02.04,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We greet you as a ceasefire ambassador.>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.93,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Your Garmillan is difficult to understand.>
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
